@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - User Login (HTTP)

actor User
participant Browser
participant Ingress as "Ingress Controller\n(Minikube)"
participant NginxProxy as "Nginx\n(Frontend & API Proxy)"
participant FrontendApp as "Vue.js SPA\n(in Browser)"
participant AuthService as "Authentication Service"
database DBAuth as "PostgreSQL\n(Authentication DB)"

User -> Browser: Accesses application URL
Browser -> Ingress: GET / (HTTP Request for SPA)
activate Ingress
Ingress -> NginxProxy: Forward GET /
activate NginxProxy
NginxProxy --> Ingress: index.html, app.js, etc. (SPA files)
Ingress --> Browser: SPA files
deactivate Ingress
Browser -[#black]> FrontendApp: Loads and renders SPA (Login UI)
deactivate NginxProxy

User -> FrontendApp: Submits Login (email, password)
activate FrontendApp
FrontendApp -> NginxProxy: POST /api/auth/login (HTTP)\n{email, password}
activate NginxProxy
NginxProxy -> AuthService: POST /login (HTTP)\n{email, password}
activate AuthService
AuthService -> DBAuth: findUserByEmail(email)
activate DBAuth
DBAuth --> AuthService: userData / null
deactivate DBAuth
group Internal Logic
    AuthService -> AuthService: Verify password
    alt Password OK
        AuthService -> AuthService: Generate JWT
    end
end
AuthService --> NginxProxy: HTTP Response\n{jwt_token} / Error (e.g., 401)
deactivate AuthService
NginxProxy --> FrontendApp: HTTP Response\n{jwt_token} / Error
deactivate NginxProxy
alt Login Successful
    FrontendApp -> User: Show Dashboard
else Login Failed
    FrontendApp -> User: Show Error Message
end
deactivate FrontendApp

@enduml